220
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:13,210
<font size="64">- I've been cooking a lot. - Really?</font>

221
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Yangnyeom fried chicken: Preparing the chicken, sauce)</font>

222
00:05:13,370 --> 00:05:14,910
