00:06:10,540 --> 00:06:12,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Running Man Outdoor Dining Flame)</font>

253
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,530
<font size="64">- It's burning. - That's right.</font>

254
