<font size="64">The flame needs to go up first.</font>

255
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Burning up)</font>

256
00:06:16,170 --> 00:06:19,440
<font size="64">It's burning nicely</font>

257
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:22,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The fire that signals the start of dinner preparations...)</font>

258
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,280
