00:44:15,520 --> 00:44:17,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Room status board is in the corner.)</font>

1770
00:44:15,550 --> 00:44:17,720
<font size="64">Private cabin, room with a bed for three,</font>

1771
00:44:17,720 --> 00:44:19,050
<font size="64">and an ondol room for four.</font>

1772
00:44:17,790 --> 00:44:20,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam, the winner, claims the private cabin.)</font>

1773
00:44:20,120 --> 00:44:22,050
<font size="64">The ondol room is for four people.</font>

1774
00:44:22,260 --> 00:44:23,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sighing)</font>

1775
00:44:24,030 --> 00:44:25,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pausing)</font>

1776
00:44:24,160 --> 00:44:25,890
<font size="64">- Hold on. - The weather isn't that cold.</font>

1777
00:44:25,890 --> 00:44:26,960
<font size="64">- Se Chan. - Yes?</font>

1778
00:44:26,960 --> 00:44:28,490
<font size="64">- You should sit next to him. - Got it.</font>

1779
00:44:28,490 --> 00:44:30,130
<font size="64">- Right. - I can't sit directly next to him.</font>

1780
00:44:30,130 --> 00:44:31,730
<font size="64">- Got it. - I feel terrible.</font>

1781
00:44:31,730 --> 00:44:33,430
<font size="64">- I'll sit between you two. - Should they even sit...</font>

1782
00:44:31,810 --> 00:44:34,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He refuses to sit at the same table as the loser.)</font>

1783
00:44:33,430 --> 00:44:35,630
<font size="64">- at the same table? - Why don't I...</font>

1784
00:44:35,410 --> 00:44:37,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stuttering)</font>

1785
00:44:35,630 --> 00:44:36,840
<font size="64">How about a rematch?</font>

1786
00:44:37,050 --> 00:44:39,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Calm down.)</font>

1787
00:44:37,070 --> 00:44:38,340
<font size="64">- No way. - Take it slow.</font>

1788
00:44:38,340 --> 00:44:39,610
<font size="64">- That's enough. - Stop humiliating yourself.</font>

1789
00:44:39,610 --> 00:44:41,370
<font size="64">Kyeong Hwan, it's just not your day today.</font>

1790
00:44:41,370 --> 00:44:43,440
<font size="64">Who does title matches back-to-back all day?</font>

1791
00:44:42,380 --> 00:44:45,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He drowns his sorrows in melon.)</font>

1792
00:44:43,440 --> 00:44:44,440
<font size="64">It would go on all night...</font>

1793
00:44:44,440 --> 00:44:46,080
<font size="64">- and even through the next day. - Until the other party wins.</font>

1794
00:44:46,150 --> 00:44:47,450
<font size="64">- No way. - What is it?</font>

1795
00:44:47,450 --> 00:44:48,610
<font size="64">Is this covered in honey?</font>

1796
00:44:48,710 --> 00:44:50,550
<font size="64">I tried some earlier, and it was surprisingly good.</font>

1797
00:44:49,120 --> 00:44:52,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sweet Cheorwon melon, a late-night treat for everyone)</font>

1798
00:44:51,550 --> 00:44:52,620
<font size="64">It's so good.</font>

1799
00:44:52,920 --> 00:44:55,420
<font size="64">I heard that Cheorwon was famous for its melons.</font>

1800
00:44:55,420 --> 00:44:56,790
<font size="64">No way.</font>

1801
00:44:56,790 --> 00:44:58,420
<font size="64">- It's so soft. - It's so sweet.</font>

1802
00:44:58,620 --> 00:45:01,430
<font size="64">- I'm full, but I can't stop. - It's even better with ice cream.</font>

1803
00:45:01,430 --> 00:45:03,330
<font size="64">- That sounds good. - Why does it sound so sad?</font>

1804
00:45:03,330 --> 00:45:05,400
<font size="64">Maybe you should say it with a smile.</font>

1805
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:07,570
<font size="64">This must be bitter for Kyeong Hwan, but I found it sweet.</font>

1806
00:45:08,280 --> 00:45:12,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The loser crumbles at the undeniable flexing.)</font>

1807
00:45:12,920 --> 00:45:15,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He lost first.)</font>

1808
00:45:13,010 --> 00:45:14,540
<font size="64">This move of his is frightening.</font>

1809
00:45:14,540 --> 00:45:16,540
<font size="64">It gets really dizzy when he makes circles.</font>

1810
00:45:16,840 --> 00:45:19,240
<font size="64">Your head spins a bit.</font>

1811
00:45:16,950 --> 00:45:20,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His magic spell leaves his opponent spellbound.)</font>

1812
00:45:19,240 --> 00:45:20,880
<font size="64">- He's like Dr. Strange. - Exactly.</font>

1813
00:45:20,950 --> 00:45:22,780
<font size="64">He makes circles with his palm, and it gets dizzy.</font>

1814
00:45:20,990 --> 00:45:24,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dr. Jee-trange)</font>

1815
00:45:23,320 --> 00:45:25,150
<font size="64">- Dr. Jee-trange. - That circling move.</font>

1816
00:45:25,480 --> 00:45:26,850
<font size="64">I felt like a dragonfly.</font>

1817
00:45:28,400 --> 00:45:30,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dizzy)</font>

1818
00:45:28,450 --> 00:45:30,060
<font size="64">And that's when he went for my name tag.</font>

1819
00:45:30,290 --> 00:45:31,690
<font size="64">It only took a split second.</font>

1820
00:45:30,700 --> 00:45:35,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Let your guard down, and you'll fall victim to his signature move.)</font>

1821
00:45:31,760 --> 00:45:33,290
<font size="64">Seok Jin's really strong.</font>

1822
00:45:33,490 --> 00:45:34,930
<font size="64">- It's true. - No kidding.</font>

1823
00:45:35,190 --> 00:45:36,500
<font size="64">- This is insane. - Ji Hyo.</font>

1824
00:45:36,500 --> 00:45:38,260
<font size="64">- Come quickly. - This is Cheorwon melon.</font>

1825
00:45:38,260 --> 00:45:39,430
<font size="64">- It's so good. - It's really good.</font>

1826
00:45:38,510 --> 00:45:41,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Hyo and Ye Eun come back from the bathroom and join them.)</font>

1827
00:45:39,430 --> 00:45:41,170
<font size="64">- The tasty melon. - It's so good.</font>

1828
00:45:41,170 --> 00:45:44,100
<font size="64">The outcome of this game will decide your rooms...</font>

1829
00:45:44,170 --> 00:45:45,570
<font size="64">and which four of you...</font>

1830
00:45:45,570 --> 00:45:47,640
<font size="64">- get to see the night view. - What?</font>

1831
00:45:47,640 --> 00:45:48,710
<font size="64">Nice.</font>

1832
00:45:48,710 --> 00:45:50,810
<font size="64">- Can you all take out your phones? - Yes.</font>

1833
00:45:50,980 --> 00:45:52,040
<font size="64">Do we need our phones?</font>

1834
00:45:52,040 --> 00:45:53,950
<font size="64">I'm terrible at games using our phones.</font>

1835
00:45:53,190 --> 00:45:56,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even Analog Kim can easily handle a mission using the phone.)</font>

1836
00:45:53,950 --> 00:45:55,650
<font size="64">- Is this... - Are we texting someone?</font>

1837
00:45:55,650 --> 00:45:58,720
<font size="64">The game is called Time It Right.</font>

1838
00:45:58,720 --> 00:46:01,320
<font size="64">- Right. - Set an alarm...</font>

1839
00:45:59,060 --> 00:46:03,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current time: 8:34pm)</font>

1840
00:46:01,620 --> 00:46:04,760
<font size="64">for any time you want after 8:49pm,</font>

1841
00:46:03,900 --> 00:46:08,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They each set an alarm for after 8:49pm and start chatting.)</font>

1842
00:46:04,920 --> 00:46:08,160
<font size="64">which is 15 minutes from now, and chat freely.</font>

1843
00:46:08,660 --> 00:46:13,800
<font size="64">If your alarm rings first or last, you're eliminated...</font>

1844
00:46:09,770 --> 00:46:12,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Penalty confirmed)</font>

1845
00:46:12,140 --> 00:46:15,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Penalty confirmed)</font>

1846
00:46:14,170 --> 00:46:15,330
<font size="64">and up for the penalty.</font>

1847
00:46:16,240 --> 00:46:17,300
<font size="64">I didn't catch that.</font>

1848
00:46:18,170 --> 00:46:19,870
<font size="64">Sorry about that. I was trying to find my phone.</font>

1849
00:46:18,610 --> 00:46:20,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He was looking for his phone and missed the instructions.)</font>

1850
00:46:19,870 --> 00:46:21,040
<font size="64">- I got distracted looking for it. - Can you explain it to him?</font>

1851
00:46:20,950 --> 00:46:24,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Kind Jong Kook explains again.)</font>

1852
00:46:21,040 --> 00:46:24,010
<font size="64">Starting at 8:49pm, your alarm can't be the first...</font>

1853
00:46:24,010 --> 00:46:25,080
<font size="64">or last to go off.</font>

1854
00:46:25,080 --> 00:46:27,580
<font size="64">- What if we overlap? - You'll both be eliminated.</font>

1855
00:46:27,580 --> 00:46:30,120
<font size="64">If over five people are up for the penalty,</font>

1856
00:46:27,720 --> 00:46:30,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(1st place, overlap, overlap, overlap, last place)</font>

1857
00:46:30,380 --> 00:46:32,580
<font size="64">anyone who overlapped gets a shot at escaping it.</font>

1858
00:46:30,960 --> 00:46:32,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(1st place, overlap, overlap, last place)</font>

1859
00:46:32,820 --> 00:46:34,620
<font size="64">Among those who survived,</font>

1860
00:46:32,930 --> 00:46:37,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(2nd place, 3rd place, 4th place)</font>

1861
00:46:34,620 --> 00:46:36,320
<font size="64">you'll choose your rooms...</font>

1862
00:46:36,320 --> 00:46:38,120
<font size="64">in the order your alarms went off.</font>

1863
00:46:38,120 --> 00:46:39,160
<font size="64">Sounds like fun.</font>

1864
00:46:38,900 --> 00:46:41,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The goal is to avoid overlapping or being the first or last to ring.)</font>

1865
00:46:39,160 --> 00:46:40,660
<font size="64">You'll set your alarms now.</font>

1866
00:46:41,160 --> 00:46:42,460
<font size="64">I'll set mine to 8:50pm.</font>

1867
00:46:43,700 --> 00:46:45,400
<font size="64">- Why you... - Se Chan, did you get the rules?</font>

1868
00:46:43,810 --> 00:46:45,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Writer)</font>

1869
00:46:45,500 --> 00:46:46,530
<font size="64">- Yes. - I don't think he did.</font>

1870
00:46:46,530 --> 00:46:47,930
<font size="64">You'll receive the penalty...</font>

1871
00:46:46,710 --> 00:46:49,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Whoever's alarm goes off 1st or last will get a penalty.)</font>

1872
00:46:47,930 --> 00:46:49,200
<font size="64">- if it goes off first or last. - First too.</font>

1873
00:46:49,640 --> 00:46:51,170
<font size="64">It's not just about avoiding overlaps.</font>

1874
00:46:49,950 --> 00:46:52,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I see!)</font>

1875
00:46:51,570 --> 00:46:52,600
<font size="64">It can't go off first either.</font>

1876
00:46:52,600 --> 00:46:54,140
<font size="64">This is driving me nuts.</font>

1877
00:46:52,850 --> 00:46:54,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thinking hard)</font>

1878
00:46:54,140 --> 00:46:56,040
<font size="64">Someone's going to overlap for sure.</font>

1879
00:46:56,280 --> 00:46:57,880
<font size="64">I'll set mine to 8:51pm.</font>

1880
00:46:59,240 --> 00:47:02,050
<font size="64">Then we'll set ours to after that, you fool.</font>

1881
00:47:03,220 --> 00:47:05,020
<font size="64">- Right, of course. - You should've just let him.</font>

1882
00:47:05,020 --> 00:47:06,050
<font size="64">- Se Chan. - Are you a fool?</font>

1883
00:47:06,050 --> 00:47:08,250
<font size="64">Se Chan's good at Name Tag Elimination,</font>

1884
00:47:06,630 --> 00:47:10,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His brain only works when it comes to ripping off name tags.)</font>

1885
00:47:08,520 --> 00:47:10,920
<font size="64">- but when it comes to brains... - I'm not the brightest.</font>

1886
00:47:10,830 --> 00:47:13,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Staring)</font>

1887
00:47:11,020 --> 00:47:12,060
<font size="64">Right.</font>

1888
00:47:12,820 --> 00:47:14,590
<font size="64">- I've set mine. - After 8:49pm, right?</font>

1889
00:47:14,690 --> 00:47:16,430
<font size="64">Yes, after 8:49pm.</font>

1890
00:47:14,940 --> 00:47:16,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Turning)</font>

1891
00:47:16,430 --> 00:47:18,130
<font size="64">- Jae Seok... - I need to reset mine.</font>

1892
00:47:16,470 --> 00:47:18,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Spotting)</font>

1893
00:47:18,130 --> 00:47:19,870
<font size="64">- This is a tough one. - Do we then set them...</font>

1894
00:47:19,070 --> 00:47:22,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Prankster Yu is blatantly snooping on his phone screen)</font>

1895
00:47:19,870 --> 00:47:21,570
<font size="64">- on the table? - That's right.</font>

1896
00:47:22,130 --> 00:47:23,500
<font size="64">When I set these things up,</font>

1897
00:47:22,680 --> 00:47:24,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He didn't notice.)</font>

1898
00:47:23,500 --> 00:47:25,940
<font size="64">I never picture myself losing the game.</font>

1899
00:47:25,110 --> 00:47:27,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Leaning way back)</font>

1900
00:47:25,940 --> 00:47:27,340
<font size="64">Look at him.</font>

1901
00:47:27,320 --> 00:47:29,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He realized just now.)</font>

1902
00:47:27,340 --> 00:47:28,510
<font size="64">Don't look.</font>

1903
00:47:28,610 --> 00:47:30,440
<font size="64">- I'm not looking. - Then...</font>

1904
00:47:31,010 --> 00:47:32,080
<font size="64">Seriously.</font>

1905
00:47:32,580 --> 00:47:35,050
<font size="64">Even while setting the alarm, I can only think of one thing.</font>

1906
00:47:36,050 --> 00:47:38,420
<font size="64">- It'll last a month. - "How did I lose?"</font>

1907
00:47:36,460 --> 00:47:39,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The aftereffect will last a month.)</font>

1908
00:47:38,820 --> 00:47:40,720
<font size="64">- I didn't see it. - Okay!</font>

1909
00:47:40,950 --> 00:47:42,720
<font size="64">- All right. - Let's do this.</font>

1910
00:47:41,260 --> 00:47:45,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, everyone set an alarm.)</font>

1911
00:47:42,720 --> 00:47:45,220
<font size="64">- Hold on. - We already enjoyed tasty rice.</font>

1912
00:47:45,490 --> 00:47:46,730
<font size="64">Ready, go.</font>

1913
00:47:46,030 --> 00:47:48,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The alarm game begins.)</font>

1914
00:47:46,730 --> 00:47:48,260
<font size="64">- The game has already begun. - Right.</font>

1915
00:47:48,240 --> 00:47:52,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current time: 8:49pm)</font>

1916
00:47:48,290 --> 00:47:49,560
<font size="64">Just talk freely.</font>

1917
00:47:49,700 --> 00:47:51,860
<font size="64">Kyeong Hwan, can you pass me that snack?</font>

1918
00:47:52,510 --> 00:47:55,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The chatting begins by provoking the loser.)</font>

1919
00:47:54,200 --> 00:47:56,100
<font size="64">I bet Kyeong Hwan's boiling inside.</font>

1920
00:47:56,170 --> 00:47:58,140
<font size="64">But since we have time before this airs,</font>

1921
00:47:58,140 --> 00:47:59,340
<font size="64">- you should talk to them... - I understand.</font>

1922
00:47:59,340 --> 00:48:01,170
<font size="64">- and stop this from airing. - Yes, stop it at all costs.</font>

1923
00:48:00,920 --> 00:48:03,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ever since he lost, he can't even ad-lib anymore.)</font>

1924
00:48:02,210 --> 00:48:04,080
<font size="64">Kyeong Hwan, it'll be all right.</font>

1925
00:48:03,520 --> 00:48:05,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's been through it.)</font>

1926
00:48:04,410 --> 00:48:05,640
<font size="64">The pain will fade with time.</font>

1927
00:48:05,640 --> 00:48:08,110
<font size="64">When does the pain in the heart actually fade away?</font>

1928
00:48:05,750 --> 00:48:08,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Teasing)</font>

1929
00:48:08,280 --> 00:48:09,750
<font size="64">It'll last at least a month.</font>

1930
00:48:08,660 --> 00:48:10,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The one who's lost before...)</font>

1931
00:48:09,850 --> 00:48:11,350
<font size="64">Plus, whenever...</font>

1932
00:48:10,360 --> 00:48:12,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(diagnoses him with a month-long injury.)</font>

1933
00:48:11,580 --> 00:48:13,150
<font size="64">you see older people,</font>

1934
00:48:13,150 --> 00:48:15,250
<font size="64">you wonder if you could actually take them.</font>

1935
00:48:15,390 --> 00:48:17,020
<font size="64">That's when you start to feel better.</font>

1936
00:48:15,700 --> 00:48:19,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's when the pain is gone.)</font>

1937
00:48:18,120 --> 00:48:19,590
<font size="64">There's also this.</font>

1938
00:48:19,760 --> 00:48:21,430
<font size="64">The nerves don't stop until the show finally airs.</font>

1939
00:48:21,300 --> 00:48:23,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exactly.)</font>

1940
00:48:21,430 --> 00:48:23,360
<font size="64">- That's right! - Right?</font>

1941
00:48:23,410 --> 00:48:26,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He just hopes it passes by quickly.)</font>

1942
00:48:23,530 --> 00:48:25,500
<font size="64">And after the show airs,</font>

1943
00:48:25,700 --> 00:48:27,030
<font size="64">you check online comments.</font>

1944
00:48:27,130 --> 00:48:28,530
<font size="64">A lot of people will ask...</font>

1945
00:48:28,530 --> 00:48:30,400
<font size="64">if you let him win.</font>

1946
00:48:28,780 --> 00:48:32,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(An unfounded match-fixing suspicion)</font>

1947
00:48:30,400 --> 00:48:31,400
<font size="64">- Really? - Yes.</font>

1948
00:48:31,400 --> 00:48:34,070
<font size="64">I told people that I lost for real.</font>

1949
00:48:32,280 --> 00:48:35,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(With confidence)</font>

1950
00:48:34,210 --> 00:48:37,510
<font size="64">I really hope you won't say that you let him win.</font>

1951
00:48:35,350 --> 00:48:37,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I really hope you won't say that you let him win for no reason.)</font>

1952
00:48:37,890 --> 00:48:40,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just as Celebrity Heo sinks to a new low)</font>

1953
00:48:37,910 --> 00:48:38,980
<font size="64">I mean it.</font>

1954
00:48:40,050 --> 00:48:42,110
<font size="64">I can't believe no alarms have gone off yet.</font>

1955
00:48:40,360 --> 00:48:44,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(10 seconds before 8:51pm)</font>

1956
00:48:42,110 --> 00:48:44,250
<font size="64">- That's amusing. - I never get caught first.</font>

1957
00:48:44,520 --> 00:48:46,920
<font size="64">It's best to come in second, right?</font>

1958
00:48:45,190 --> 00:48:49,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If someone's alarm goes off, they'll be eliminated right away!)</font>

1959
00:48:46,920 --> 00:48:48,320
<font size="64">- That's right. - Second place is the best.</font>

1960
00:48:48,320 --> 00:48:49,650
<font size="64">Yes, second place is the best.</font>

1961
00:48:49,650 --> 00:48:50,760
<font size="64">The game will soon begin.</font>

