2343
00:57:56,070 --> 00:57:57,640
<font size="64">I don't trust myself either.</font>

2344
00:57:57,640 --> 00:58:00,040
<font size="64">- Right? - Because in my sleep...</font>

2345
00:57:58,450 --> 00:58:01,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He can't keep his sticky fingers under control.)</font>

2346
00:58:00,040 --> 00:58:01,610
<font size="64">- He feels the urge to betray. - Yes.</font>

