2351
00:58:07,850 --> 00:58:09,280
<font size="64">Well, actually...</font>

2352
00:58:09,350 --> 00:58:11,350
<font size="64">- Okay. Sorry. - Anything hard...</font>

2353
00:58:09,590 --> 00:58:12,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He apologizes in advance.)</font>

2354
00:58:13,150 --> 00:58:16,150
<font size="64">Where should I hide them? Let's see.</font>

2355
00:58:13,190 --> 00:58:16,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While the pact falls through, Seok Sam...)</font>

2356
00:58:17,300 --> 00:58:20,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(starts hiding his eggs without being disturbed.)</font>

2357
