00:58:20,430 --> 00:58:23,030
<font size="64">The first place that came to mind.</font>

2360
00:58:23,440 --> 00:58:26,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 1)</font>

2361
00:58:24,500 --> 00:58:27,970
