<font size="64">The first egg.</font>

2364
00:58:30,900 --> 00:58:33,270
<font size="64">If only I could put one in here.</font>

2365
00:58:33,350 --> 00:58:35,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Inside an actual lamp)</font>

2366
00:58:36,150 --> 00:58:38,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's not easy to fix it.)</font>

2367
00:58:36,740 --> 00:58:39,510
<font size="64">Shoot. Where should I hide them?</font>

2368
00:58:39,850 --> 00:58:42,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Checking the outside porch)</font>

2369
00:58:39,880 --> 00:58:41,050
<font size="64">On the terrace?</font>

2370
00:58:43,310 --> 00:58:44,480
<font size="64">Darn it.</font>

2371
00:58:44,390 --> 00:58:49,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The easiest target tries hard to hide his eggs.)</font>

2372
00:58:45,150 --> 00:58:48,150
<font size="64">How come... There are no hiding spots.</font>

2373
00:58:49,320 --> 00:58:50,960
<font size="64">Is it okay to hide them out here?</font>

2374
00:58:50,630 --> 00:58:52,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Looking everywhere)</font>

2375
