<font size="64">Hey.</font>

2376
00:58:55,770 --> 00:59:00,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 2, a camera pouch)</font>

2377
00:58:55,860 --> 00:58:57,330
<font size="64">Okay. This will do.</font>

2378
00:58:58,000 --> 00:59:01,330
<font size="64">No one will find this. It's well-hidden.</font>

2379
00:59:01,330 --> 00:59:02,700
<font size="64">No one can tell it's there.</font>

2380
00:59:03,230 --> 00:59:05,800
<font size="64">What if I forget the hiding places?</font>

2381
00:59:06,240 --> 00:59:09,040
<font size="64">Where I left the eggs...</font>

2382
00:59:09,140 --> 00:59:10,310
<font size="64">The last one.</font>

