00:59:11,650 --> 00:59:13,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ripping sound)</font>

2384
00:59:13,610 --> 00:59:15,780
<font size="64">I have no choice. I'll stick it somewhere.</font>

2385
00:59:18,550 --> 00:59:20,180
<font size="64">If I stick it on the top of this...</font>

2386
00:59:22,100 --> 00:59:26,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 3, inside the cabinet under the sink)</font>

2387
00:59:22,190 --> 00:59:23,320
<font size="64">Right here.</font>

2388
00:59:23,490 --> 00:59:25,920
<font size="64">No one will find it.</font>

2389
00:59:26,960 --> 00:59:28,990
<font size="64">There. Like this.</font>

2390
00:59:27,100 --> 00:59:30,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He even used tape to hide his eggs.)</font>

2391
00:59:31,410 --> 00:59:35,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 16-year veteran hid all 5.)</font>

2392
00:59:31,560 --> 00:59:32,860
<font size="64">I hid all five of them.</font>

2393
00:59:33,870 --> 00:59:35,470
