2401
00:59:45,280 --> 00:59:47,080
<font size="64">- Promise. - I'll doubt you if you do this.</font>

2402
00:59:47,080 --> 00:59:49,180
<font size="64">I'm doing this because I don't trust you.</font>

2403
00:59:49,180 --> 00:59:51,180
<font size="64">- What the... - I don't trust you.</font>

2404
00:59:49,220 --> 00:59:52,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Smirking)</font>

2405
00:59:51,180 --> 00:59:52,680
<font size="64">- Trust me. - You're serious?</font>

2406
00:59:52,630 --> 00:59:56,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They can't let their guard down either.)</font>

2407
00:59:52,680 --> 00:59:53,990
<font size="64">- You promise? - I won't go after you.</font>

2408
00:59:54,020 --> 00:59:55,120
<font size="64">- You're sure? - Yes.</font>

2409
00:59:56,920 --> 00:59:58,960
<font size="64">The hiding places are too obvious.</font>

2410
00:59:57,170 --> 01:00:01,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They trust each other and start hiding their eggs.)</font>

2411
00:59:58,960 --> 01:00:00,260
<font size="64">There's nowhere to hide them.</font>

2412
01:00:00,320 --> 01:00:02,190
<font size="64">Where should I hide them?</font>

2413
01:00:02,790 --> 01:00:04,530
<font size="64">I'll hide one in here.</font>

2414
01:00:05,130 --> 01:00:07,100
<font size="64">Inside a cup.</font>

2415
01:00:08,040 --> 01:00:12,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 1, in a cup in the cabinet)</font>

2416
01:00:08,530 --> 01:00:09,600
<font size="64">I hid one.</font>

2417
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:12,440
<font size="64">I hid one in here.</font>

2418
01:00:13,040 --> 01:00:15,510
<font size="64">I'll hide one in the coffee pot.</font>

2419
01:00:15,520 --> 01:00:19,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 2, in a coffee pot)</font>

2420
01:00:16,510 --> 01:00:19,180
<font size="64">The other room will be worse than us.</font>

2421
01:00:19,920 --> 01:00:22,890
