<font size="64">They're so hard to hide.</font>

2424
01:00:23,520 --> 01:00:26,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 1, on top of the curtain rod in the living room)</font>

2425
01:00:24,350 --> 01:00:26,250
<font size="64">Should I put one more up there?</font>

2426
01:00:26,580 --> 01:00:28,390
<font size="64">I don't think anyone will find that one.</font>

2427
01:00:28,490 --> 01:00:29,520
<font size="64">- Right. - Yes.</font>

2428
01:00:29,990 --> 01:00:31,060
<font size="64">No one will find it.</font>

2429
01:00:30,230 --> 01:00:34,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hiding spot 2, taped to a curtain)</font>

2430
01:00:32,060 --> 01:00:34,190
<font size="64">It might break when I rip it off.</font>

2431
01:00:34,690 --> 01:00:36,490
<font size="64">I'll keep the last one with me.</font>

2432
