<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is it better to keep her egg with her than to hide it?)</font>

2438
01:00:42,030 --> 01:00:43,840
<font size="64">Or in my pillow.</font>

2439
01:00:43,940 --> 01:00:45,200
<font size="64">What if I can't find them later?</font>

2440
01:00:45,250 --> 01:00:48,220
