<font size="64">Wouldn't the end be better?</font>

2442
01:00:48,010 --> 01:00:50,240
<font size="64">- They might not notice. - Right?</font>

2443
01:00:49,250 --> 01:00:50,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dropping)</font>

2444
01:00:50,280 --> 01:00:51,520
