01:01:02,930 --> 01:01:05,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She broke it herself.)</font>

2453
01:01:05,760 --> 01:01:08,630
<font size="64">It's so annoying how I cracked one.</font>

2454
01:01:05,830 --> 01:01:08,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Egg Status: 4)</font>

2455
01:01:08,540 --> 01:01:10,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Half-heartedly)</font>

2456
01:01:08,630 --> 01:01:09,760
<font size="64">I know, right?</font>

2457
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:12,100
<font size="64">I hid all of mine.</font>

2458
01:01:12,400 --> 01:01:14,070
<font size="64">I'll take two to bed with me.</font>

2459
01:01:12,510 --> 01:01:14,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(HIding her eggs makes her even more nervous.)</font>

2460
01:01:15,330 --> 01:01:17,540
<font size="64">Let's get some sleep.</font>

2461
01:01:15,340 --> 01:01:19,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, these 5 members are still locked in a standoff.)</font>

2462
01:01:17,970 --> 01:01:19,140
<font size="64">We need to sleep.</font>

2463
01:01:19,140 --> 01:01:22,170
<font size="64">Let's shower. Will anyone attack while someone's in the shower?</font>

2464
01:01:19,750 --> 01:01:22,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Keeping them in check)</font>

2465
01:01:22,170 --> 01:01:24,240
<font size="64">Let's leave the eggs in a safe zone while we shower.</font>

2466
01:01:24,240 --> 01:01:26,040
<font size="64">- Yes. - While we shower...</font>

2467
01:01:25,990 --> 01:01:29,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They propose a ceasefire while they take turns showering.)</font>

2468
01:01:26,040 --> 01:01:28,250
<font size="64">- That's right. - That wouldn't be fair.</font>

2469
01:01:28,250 --> 01:01:29,250
<font size="64">True.</font>

2470
01:01:29,250 --> 01:01:31,280
<font size="64">- While we shower... - Can you control yourself?</font>

2471
01:01:31,280 --> 01:01:33,320
<font size="64">- Shower time is off limits. - Okay.</font>

2472
01:01:31,590 --> 01:01:34,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Okay)</font>

2473
01:01:33,320 --> 01:01:34,990
<font size="64">- Let's put them down. - Tell that to yourself.</font>

2474
01:01:34,100 --> 01:01:37,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tell that to yourself.)</font>

2475
01:01:34,990 --> 01:01:36,420
<font size="64">You shower first, then.</font>

2476
01:01:36,420 --> 01:01:38,490
<font size="64">- Se Chan. Don't do it. - Don't do it, Se Chan.</font>

2477
01:01:37,730 --> 01:01:39,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Betrayal)</font>

2478
01:01:38,490 --> 01:01:39,960
<font size="64">This is the safe zone.</font>

2479
01:01:39,770 --> 01:01:41,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Telling himself)</font>

2480
01:01:39,960 --> 01:01:41,530
<font size="64">It's foul to attack during shower time.</font>

2481
01:01:41,530 --> 01:01:43,630
<font size="64">We must watch the safe zone, then.</font>

2482
01:01:43,630 --> 01:01:45,460
<font size="64">Someone could barge in unannounced.</font>

2483
01:01:45,460 --> 01:01:46,660
<font size="64">- Let's stand guard. - Okay.</font>

2484
01:01:46,660 --> 01:01:47,670
<font size="64">Let's protect each other's eggs.</font>

2485
01:01:47,670 --> 01:01:48,930
<font size="64">- Good idea. - Okay.</font>

2486
01:01:48,940 --> 01:01:51,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They decide to keep an eye out for outside threats first.)</font>

2487
01:01:49,000 --> 01:01:50,170
<font size="64">- Let's do a cheer. - We're allies.</font>

2488
01:01:50,170 --> 01:01:51,270
<font size="64">- All right. - Let's go.</font>

2489
01:01:51,270 --> 01:01:53,170
<font size="64">- In 1, 2, 3. Let's go. - In 1, 2, 3. Let's go.</font>

2490
01:01:52,650 --> 01:01:55,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Their shower-time peace treaty is barely holding together.)</font>

2491
01:01:53,170 --> 01:01:55,110
<font size="64">- If anyone comes, guard the eggs. - That's right.</font>

2492
01:01:55,110 --> 01:01:57,180
<font size="64">- Guard the eggs. - Let's protect each other's eggs.</font>

2493
01:01:56,150 --> 01:01:58,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Now they decide on a safe zone.)</font>

2494
01:01:57,180 --> 01:01:59,440
<font size="64">The safe zone should be in a corner.</font>

2495
01:01:59,440 --> 01:02:01,450
<font size="64">- That way, anyone who comes... - How about inside the microwave?</font>

2496
01:02:01,760 --> 01:02:04,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The microwave is a perfect spot to keep eggs safe.)</font>

2497
01:02:02,310 --> 01:02:03,510
<font size="64">- Right? - Right.</font>

2498
01:02:03,510 --> 01:02:04,580
<font size="64">- Don't... - Not bad.</font>

2499
01:02:04,580 --> 01:02:05,820
<font size="64">- Don't microwave them. - Not bad.</font>

2500
01:02:04,830 --> 01:02:07,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Don't microwave them and crack them.)</font>

2501
01:02:06,050 --> 01:02:07,520
<font size="64">- Don't microwave them. - I like that idea.</font>

2502
01:02:07,520 --> 01:02:09,220
<font size="64">- Inside the microwave is good. - Good.</font>

2503
01:02:09,320 --> 01:02:11,490
<font size="64">Even if someone comes,</font>

2504
01:02:09,660 --> 01:02:13,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The official safe zone, the microwave)</font>

2505
01:02:11,490 --> 01:02:13,120
<font size="64">- they'll be stored inside. - That's right. Good idea.</font>

2506
01:02:13,260 --> 01:02:14,790
<font size="64">- Who wants to wash up first? - Who?</font>

2507
01:02:14,790 --> 01:02:15,960
<font size="64">Who will wash up first?</font>

2508
01:02:16,190 --> 01:02:18,130
<font size="64">- What? - Washing up? The oldest one.</font>

2509
01:02:16,970 --> 01:02:19,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok first)</font>

2510
01:02:19,000 --> 01:02:20,400
<font size="64">- What? - The oldest one, of course.</font>

2511
01:02:19,040 --> 01:02:22,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Turning)</font>

2512
01:02:20,400 --> 01:02:21,570
<font size="64">You should go first.</font>

2513
01:02:21,930 --> 01:02:23,330
<font size="64">Then I'll take the eggs with me.</font>

2514
01:02:24,070 --> 01:02:25,840
<font size="64">- Come on. - Don't be like that.</font>

2515
01:02:24,810 --> 01:02:27,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He isn't sure about going in first.)</font>

2516
01:02:25,840 --> 01:02:27,840
<font size="64">- We promised to trust each other. - We respect the elders.</font>

2517
01:02:27,840 --> 01:02:28,940
<font size="64">That'll be safer.</font>

2518
01:02:28,940 --> 01:02:30,580
<font size="64">It's so funny to watch him go and wash up...</font>

2519
01:02:29,420 --> 01:02:32,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok takes his eggs with him into the shower.)</font>

2520
01:02:30,580 --> 01:02:31,880
<font size="64">with the eggs.</font>

2521
01:02:32,210 --> 01:02:33,480
<font size="64">I'll be back.</font>

2522
01:02:33,480 --> 01:02:34,580
<font size="64">Okay, Jong Kook. Go and wash up.</font>

2523
01:02:34,320 --> 01:02:36,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(My precious eggs)</font>

2524
01:02:36,720 --> 01:02:40,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook also brings his eggs with him.)</font>

2525
01:02:37,050 --> 01:02:39,050
<font size="64">Everyone is taking the tray of eggs...</font>

2526
01:02:39,180 --> 01:02:40,850
<font size="64">as if it's a shower basket.</font>

2527
01:02:40,390 --> 01:02:43,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The two eldest ones head to the shower room.)</font>

2528
01:02:40,850 --> 01:02:43,550
<font size="64">It's so funny to watch him go and wash up with the eggs.</font>

2529
01:02:44,790 --> 01:02:46,260
<font size="64">Haha.</font>

2530
01:02:46,260 --> 01:02:47,690
<font size="64">Let's break Jae Seok's eggs.</font>

2531
01:02:48,370 --> 01:02:50,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They betray them right away.)</font>

2532
01:02:48,460 --> 01:02:49,730
<font size="64">- Let's break them. - Yes.</font>

2533
01:02:49,730 --> 01:02:51,230
<font size="64">- We need to do it now. - Now?</font>

2534
01:02:50,140 --> 01:02:54,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok is showering.)</font>

2535
01:02:51,230 --> 01:02:53,200
<font size="64">Do it when he is washing up. He is in his underwear.</font>

2536
01:02:54,300 --> 01:02:56,000
<font size="64">- Film it with your phone. - Hey.</font>

2537
01:02:56,270 --> 01:02:58,070
<font size="64">- Haha, that's too much. - Why?</font>

2538
01:02:57,550 --> 01:02:59,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The one with the dirth mustache wants to strike...)</font>

2539
01:02:58,070 --> 01:02:59,570
<font size="64">If we do that, all of our eggs will be destroyed as well.</font>

2540
01:02:59,410 --> 01:03:01,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(when they're caught off guard.)</font>

2541
01:02:59,570 --> 01:03:01,010
<font size="64">This is our chance.</font>

