3161
01:20:06,610 --> 01:20:08,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The purple ones are Se Chan's.)</font>

3162
01:20:07,160 --> 01:20:09,070
<font size="64">- Green. The green ones are mine. - Green.</font>

3163
01:20:09,070 --> 01:20:10,070
<font size="64">The purple ones are mine, Jae Seok.</font>

3164
