3184
01:20:40,700 --> 01:20:42,030
<font size="64">Let's go get Jae Seok.</font>

3185
01:20:42,030 --> 01:20:44,100
<font size="64">Let's tape it to our bodies.</font>

3186
01:20:44,100 --> 01:20:45,500
<font size="64">- Let's tape it. - It won't work like this.</font>

3187
01:20:46,600 --> 01:20:47,670
<font size="64">I won't leave him in peace.</font>

3188
01:20:46,710 --> 01:20:49,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's taping the basket to his stomach.)</font>

3189
01:20:48,710 --> 01:20:50,340
<font size="64">That's really...</font>

3190
01:20:50,250 --> 01:20:52,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The war mode for Axe Kim is on.)</font>

3191
01:20:50,570 --> 01:20:52,210
<font size="64">This is...</font>

3192
01:20:52,940 --> 01:20:54,780
