3219
01:21:41,970 --> 01:21:43,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dumbfounded)</font>

3220
01:21:44,290 --> 01:21:46,800
<font size="64">- I guess he found us annoying. - He couldn't help it.</font>

3221
