3230
01:22:02,050 --> 01:22:04,050
<font size="64">- We won't be sleeping anyway. - Right.</font>

3231
01:22:04,310 --> 01:22:05,480
<font size="64">Shall we take some with us?</font>

3232
01:22:05,480 --> 01:22:07,550
