3242
01:22:23,130 --> 01:22:26,000
<font size="64">We could have just slept in peace.</font>

3243
01:22:26,200 --> 01:22:28,810
<font size="64">We bonded over this, Se Chan.</font>

3244
01:22:28,810 --> 01:22:29,870
<font size="64">Thank you.</font>

3245
01:22:29,870 --> 01:22:31,910
<font size="64">- I got mad when I saw what he did. - I also got mad.</font>

3246
01:22:31,910 --> 01:22:33,680
<font size="64">Why did he suddenly...</font>

3247
01:22:32,650 --> 01:22:34,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The egg thieves develop a strong bond of camaraderie.)</font>

3248
01:22:33,680 --> 01:22:35,080
<font size="64">- There was no need for that. - He...</font>

3249
