<font size="64">- That's enough. - Take it out.</font>

3250
01:22:36,860 --> 01:22:39,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They've added hot water.)</font>

3251
01:22:38,480 --> 01:22:40,780
<font size="64">- Let's go. Let's go torment him. - I'm coming.</font>

3252
01:22:39,730 --> 01:22:42,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Let's go inside.)</font>

3253
01:22:43,290 --> 01:22:44,850
<font size="64">How can he sleep?</font>

3254
01:22:45,790 --> 01:22:47,460
<font size="64">How can he sleep after what he's done?</font>

3255
01:22:51,660 --> 01:22:53,660
<font size="64">Why did you...</font>

3256
01:22:53,700 --> 01:22:56,400
<font size="64">Why did you break Se Chan's eggs?</font>

3257
01:22:56,400 --> 01:22:57,770
<font size="64">He started it first.</font>

3258
01:22:58,710 --> 01:23:01,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's true.)</font>

3259
01:23:00,070 --> 01:23:03,210
<font size="64">He started it first. He should get punished.</font>

3260
01:23:02,150 --> 01:23:04,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Starting a ramyeon hearing)</font>

3261
01:23:03,440 --> 01:23:04,440
<font size="64">That's not it.</font>

3262
01:23:04,440 --> 01:23:05,980
<font size="64">That is what happened.</font>

3263
01:23:05,980 --> 01:23:07,280
<font size="64">We're a team.</font>

3264
01:23:07,280 --> 01:23:10,010
<font size="64">No, we're not. You tried to leave me behind.</font>

3265
01:23:10,010 --> 01:23:11,050
<font size="64">No.</font>

3266
01:23:11,550 --> 01:23:14,280
<font size="64">Jae Seok. They were going to leave me behind at first.</font>

3267
01:23:12,730 --> 01:23:15,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(These guys)</font>

3268
01:23:14,280 --> 01:23:16,250
<font size="64">- Exactly. - But...</font>

3269
01:23:16,750 --> 01:23:18,460
<font size="64">they were caught right there.</font>

3270
01:23:17,730 --> 01:23:20,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam's foot moved.)</font>

3271
01:23:20,590 --> 01:23:22,060
<font size="64">- Listen... - Where did you hide them?</font>

3272
01:23:20,900 --> 01:23:23,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pressuring)</font>

3273
01:23:22,130 --> 01:23:23,490
<font size="64">I can't tell you.</font>

3274
01:23:23,860 --> 01:23:27,000
<font size="64">If you mess with me, I'll wake Kyeong Hwan and everyone up.</font>

3275
01:23:27,540 --> 01:23:28,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kyeong Hwan)</font>

3276
01:23:28,680 --> 01:23:30,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If they both wake up, it's going to be a disaster.)</font>

3277
