<font size="64">Really?</font>

3278
01:23:30,910 --> 01:23:33,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam)</font>

3279
01:23:31,030 --> 01:23:33,940
<font size="64">Let's be quiet...</font>

3280
01:23:34,880 --> 01:23:37,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He found what's on their stomachs.)</font>

3281
01:23:35,970 --> 01:23:37,670
<font size="64">Did you put them there?</font>

3282
01:23:39,450 --> 01:23:43,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

3283
01:23:41,310 --> 01:23:43,850
<font size="64">It's too tight. My stomach is about to explode.</font>

3284
01:23:44,480 --> 01:23:46,120
<font size="64">We came ready to fight.</font>

3285
01:23:46,560 --> 01:23:48,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fearlessness)</font>

3286
01:23:46,750 --> 01:23:47,980
<font size="64">If you want to fight, let's fight.</font>

3287
01:23:48,380 --> 01:23:50,590
<font size="64">I'll wake up Seok Jin and everyone else.</font>

3288
01:23:50,590 --> 01:23:53,020
<font size="64">- We don't want that either. - Right.</font>

3289
01:23:53,020 --> 01:23:55,830
<font size="64">Let's be quiet. You can eat quietly and sleep.</font>

3290
01:23:55,830 --> 01:23:57,390
<font size="64">Are you not going to sleep?</font>

3291
01:23:56,770 --> 01:23:59,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eating)</font>

3292
01:24:00,760 --> 01:24:02,100
<font size="64">I'm going to sleep.</font>

3293
01:24:01,140 --> 01:24:03,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok lies down.)</font>

3294
01:24:05,470 --> 01:24:07,100
<font size="64">He hid them in his underwear.</font>

3295
01:24:05,550 --> 01:24:07,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Persistent)</font>

3296
01:24:07,910 --> 01:24:09,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ignoring)</font>

3297
01:24:10,070 --> 01:24:11,240
