3304
01:24:25,660 --> 01:24:28,760
<font size="64">Stop it.</font>

3305
01:24:26,700 --> 01:24:28,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

3306
01:24:28,570 --> 01:24:30,440
