3307
01:24:28,960 --> 01:24:30,060
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

3308
01:24:30,440 --> 01:24:32,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's really time to sleep.)</font>

3309
01:24:33,570 --> 01:24:36,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Removing their baskets)</font>

3310
01:24:38,570 --> 01:24:40,200
<font size="64">Did you break them?</font>

3311
01:24:40,200 --> 01:24:41,340
<font size="64">One broke.</font>

3312
01:24:41,610 --> 01:24:42,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Egg Status)</font>

3313
01:24:42,410 --> 01:24:44,040
<font size="64">You idiot.</font>

3314
01:24:42,620 --> 01:24:46,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan only has 2 eggs now.)</font>

3315
01:24:44,970 --> 01:24:46,210
<font size="64">He's an idiot.</font>

