<font size="64">It hurts.</font>

3317
01:24:47,720 --> 01:24:52,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Grinding his teeth)</font>

3318
01:24:49,980 --> 01:24:52,850
<font size="64">Seok Jin must be so upset to be grinding his teeth like that.</font>

3319
01:24:53,820 --> 01:24:55,290
<font size="64">Let's be nice to him tomorrow.</font>

3320
01:24:56,260 --> 01:24:59,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The wild night came to an end like that.)</font>

3321
01:24:59,830 --> 01:25:04,270
