3322
01:25:04,270 --> 01:25:06,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook's alarm goes off.)</font>

3323
01:25:08,810 --> 01:25:10,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Checking the time)</font>

3324
