<font size="64">Who is it?</font>

3520
01:32:39,560 --> 01:32:43,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After finishing the egg garnish while holding his breath,)</font>

3521
01:32:45,970 --> 01:32:50,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(he attacked Haha's steamed eggs as soon as it was done.)</font>

3522
01:32:51,470 --> 01:32:53,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dejected)</font>

3523
01:32:53,960 --> 01:32:55,160
<font size="64">Darn it.</font>

3524
01:32:55,210 --> 01:32:58,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current time: 5:29am)</font>

3525
01:32:58,510 --> 01:33:00,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Annoyed)</font>

3526
01:32:58,570 --> 01:33:00,170
<font size="64">You're good at making steamed eggs.</font>

3527
01:33:01,070 --> 01:33:02,610
<font size="64">I'm hurt.</font>

3528
01:33:02,420 --> 01:33:04,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current time: 5:30am)</font>

3529
01:33:02,710 --> 01:33:04,510
<font size="64">Hey, good luck.</font>

3530
01:33:05,050 --> 01:33:07,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He sets off for the wooden bench, where he needs to submit his dish.)</font>

3531
01:33:07,480 --> 01:33:09,080
<font size="64">What? Someone already submitted theirs?</font>

3532
01:33:09,910 --> 01:33:10,950
<font size="64">Who is this?</font>

3533
01:33:10,660 --> 01:33:12,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(There are already two dishes?)</font>

3534
01:33:12,390 --> 01:33:13,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The ones who made the two dishes...)</font>

3535
01:33:12,450 --> 01:33:13,520
<font size="64">Who came already?</font>

3536
01:33:14,560 --> 01:33:16,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tomato-egg stir-fry)</font>

3537
01:33:16,000 --> 01:33:18,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(By Chef Yang!)</font>

3538
01:33:19,270 --> 01:33:21,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And fried eggs by Chef Yu)</font>

3539
01:33:21,190 --> 01:33:24,260
<font size="64">- Okay! - Okay!</font>

3540
01:33:21,470 --> 01:33:24,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They waited there and submitted it the moment the clock hit 5:30am!)</font>

3541
01:33:24,940 --> 01:33:27,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exempt from the breakfast duty)</font>

3542
01:33:25,260 --> 01:33:27,260
<font size="64">- We did it anyway. - Can we go up there now?</font>

3543
01:33:27,660 --> 01:33:29,400
<font size="64">Jong Kook, you succeeded in making the egg garnish.</font>

3544
01:33:27,670 --> 01:33:30,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook is safe in 3rd place.)</font>

3545
01:33:29,870 --> 01:33:31,700
<font size="64">You can rest until the breakfast is ready.</font>

3546
01:33:31,700 --> 01:33:34,000
<font size="64">I thought I had enough time, but it was a close call.</font>

3547
01:33:34,000 --> 01:33:35,840
<font size="64">- How many? Four? - Four.</font>

3548
01:33:34,310 --> 01:33:38,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Now there's only one spot left.)</font>

3549
01:33:37,570 --> 01:33:38,770
<font size="64">It was so close.</font>

3550
01:33:39,950 --> 01:33:43,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A cooking battle with a morning break on the line)</font>

3551
01:33:42,140 --> 01:33:43,750
<font size="64">Hurry up and break already.</font>

3552
01:33:46,050 --> 01:33:47,780
<font size="64">Seriously, this takes forever.</font>

3553
01:33:48,430 --> 01:33:50,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bragging about it in the middle of all this)</font>

3554
01:33:51,130 --> 01:33:54,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The last member to avoid the morning duty)</font>

3555
01:33:52,220 --> 01:33:53,390
<font size="64">I need seven pieces.</font>

3556
01:33:53,390 --> 01:33:54,820
<font size="64">It's done. It's broken.</font>

3557
01:33:54,890 --> 01:33:56,030
<font size="64">Who is it?</font>

3558
01:33:55,970 --> 01:33:58,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who will be the last one to enjoy that happiness?)</font>

3559
01:33:56,060 --> 01:33:57,060
<font size="64">Hurry up.</font>

3560
01:33:57,390 --> 01:33:58,490
<font size="64">Hurry up.</font>

3561
01:33:58,890 --> 01:33:59,930
<font size="64">Hurry.</font>

3562
01:33:59,270 --> 01:34:01,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's Haha.)</font>

3563
01:34:01,660 --> 01:34:03,630
<font size="64">Haha, you succeeded.</font>

3564
01:34:01,770 --> 01:34:04,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The last lucky guy is Haha, the steamed egg guy.)</font>

3565
01:34:03,630 --> 01:34:04,730
<font size="64">Well done.</font>

3566
01:34:04,730 --> 01:34:07,100
<font size="64">When on earth did these two already finish this?</font>

3567
01:34:07,650 --> 01:34:11,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok, Se Chan, Jong Kook, and Haha are exempt from cooking.)</font>

3568
01:34:07,900 --> 01:34:09,040
<font size="64">I was so surprised. Let's go.</font>

3569
01:34:10,370 --> 01:34:11,410
<font size="64">You've been working hard since early dawn.</font>

3570
01:34:11,050 --> 01:34:15,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Breakfast duty)</font>

3571
01:34:11,410 --> 01:34:13,210
<font size="64">It was worth working hard through the night.</font>

3572
01:34:13,210 --> 01:34:15,140
<font size="64">We have to be this ruthless just to get some rest?</font>

3573
01:34:15,780 --> 01:34:19,280
<font size="64">Ji Hyo, Seok Jin, Ye Eun, and Kyeong Hwan.</font>

3574
01:34:17,590 --> 01:34:21,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The menus the breakfast duty will make)</font>

3575
01:34:19,280 --> 01:34:21,020
<font size="64">You will make breakfast now.</font>

3576
01:34:21,020 --> 01:34:22,750
<font size="64">You will make janchi guksu.</font>

3577
01:34:21,390 --> 01:34:23,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Janchi guksu)</font>

3578
01:34:22,750 --> 01:34:24,550
<font size="64">- Let's just make it quickly. - Let's cook.</font>

3579
01:34:24,400 --> 01:34:27,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current time: 5:41am)</font>

3580
01:34:24,550 --> 01:34:26,820
<font size="64">So they are waiting, and we are preparing breakfast...</font>

3581
01:34:26,820 --> 01:34:28,620
<font size="64">- for them. - We're cooking breakfast.</font>

3582
01:34:27,830 --> 01:34:30,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The winners comfortably go back to sleep.)</font>

3583
01:34:28,860 --> 01:34:30,990
<font size="64">- This is upsetting. - It's okay.</font>

3584
01:34:31,130 --> 01:34:33,700
<font size="64">A lot of things happened last night.</font>

3585
01:34:31,700 --> 01:34:35,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ironically, the ones who had a good sleep remain.)</font>

3586
01:34:33,830 --> 01:34:36,170
<font size="64">The ones who slept soundly are here now.</font>

3587
01:34:37,800 --> 01:34:39,670
<font size="64">Well... Okay. I get that.</font>

3588
01:34:38,510 --> 01:34:41,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Okay, I got it.)</font>

3589
01:34:39,670 --> 01:34:41,000
<font size="64">I accept it.</font>

3590
01:34:41,270 --> 01:34:44,170
<font size="64">But how could they invite a guest and put him in a separate room...</font>

3591
01:34:44,470 --> 01:34:45,910
<font size="64">and plot behind his back?</font>

3592
01:34:45,910 --> 01:34:47,710
<font size="64">I really must be naive.</font>

3593
01:34:47,780 --> 01:34:50,550
<font size="64">The thought of taking the microwave outside never even crossed my mind.</font>

3594
01:34:50,750 --> 01:34:53,120
<font size="64">Since a few eggs were already broken anyway,</font>

3595
01:34:50,960 --> 01:34:55,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Superstar Heo is wrecked for 2 days.)</font>

3596
01:34:53,120 --> 01:34:55,550
<font size="64">I figured we'd all just sleep comfortably among ourselves.</font>

3597
01:34:55,550 --> 01:34:57,720
<font size="64">And the cat ate all my eggs.</font>

3598
01:34:55,560 --> 01:34:58,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even the cat gave him a hard time.)</font>

3599
01:34:59,590 --> 01:35:01,060
<font size="64">It will taste good when it's done.</font>

3600
01:35:01,060 --> 01:35:02,360
<font size="64">- Sure. - It's strangely good.</font>

3601
01:35:02,700 --> 01:35:05,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Making broth with kelp)</font>

3602
01:35:03,030 --> 01:35:04,260
<font size="64">- Is this good? - Is the water enough?</font>

3603
01:35:04,260 --> 01:35:05,790
<font size="64">Sure. It's enough.</font>

3604
01:35:05,790 --> 01:35:07,100
<font size="64">Have you cooked janchi guksu before?</font>

3605
01:35:07,100 --> 01:35:08,230
<font size="64">Of course.</font>

3606
01:35:08,440 --> 01:35:10,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Of course)</font>

3607
01:35:08,500 --> 01:35:10,500
<font size="64">Is there anything I haven't tried at this age?</font>

3608
01:35:10,510 --> 01:35:12,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pouring soy sauce)</font>

3609
01:35:10,570 --> 01:35:13,670
<font size="64">- Soy sauce and tuna sauce. - No, kitty.</font>

3610
01:35:13,580 --> 01:35:16,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 60-year-old chef doesn't need to measure.)</font>

3611
01:35:13,840 --> 01:35:15,170
<font size="64">- That's it. Yes. - Tuna sauce.</font>

3612
01:35:15,270 --> 01:35:16,970
<font size="64">- And soy sauce. - Yes.</font>

3613
01:35:17,140 --> 01:35:18,270
<font size="64">Even after going through all that,</font>

3614
01:35:17,380 --> 01:35:20,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Doubting)</font>

3615
01:35:18,270 --> 01:35:20,480
<font size="64">do I have to work hard to make breakfast for them?</font>

3616
01:35:20,250 --> 01:35:22,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Prepping vegetables: Kyeong Hwan and Ji Hyo)</font>

3617
01:35:20,480 --> 01:35:22,110
<font size="64">You could feel that way.</font>

3618
01:35:22,960 --> 01:35:25,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seasoning: Ye Eun)</font>

3619
01:35:23,210 --> 01:35:25,410
<font size="64">The broth will be done in no time.</font>

3620
01:35:25,410 --> 01:35:26,420
<font size="64">- What are you making? - The seasoning sauce.</font>

3621
01:35:25,620 --> 01:35:28,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Complaining, but she does her best.)</font>

3622
01:35:26,420 --> 01:35:27,820
<font size="64">The all-purpose seasoning sauce.</font>

3623
01:35:29,120 --> 01:35:30,190
<font size="64">Is it done?</font>

3624
01:35:30,190 --> 01:35:32,520
<font size="64">The water just won't come to a proper boil.</font>

3625
01:35:30,530 --> 01:35:32,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Teasing)</font>

3626
01:35:33,220 --> 01:35:34,720
<font size="64">It needs to be boiling hard.</font>

3627
01:35:34,720 --> 01:35:36,260
<font size="64">It will boil soon, Seok Jin.</font>

3628
01:35:36,260 --> 01:35:37,390
<font size="64">Just wait a little more.</font>

3629
01:35:37,400 --> 01:35:39,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Opening)</font>

3630
01:35:40,560 --> 01:35:42,360
<font size="64">Strangely, it always tastes good...</font>

3631
01:35:42,360 --> 01:35:44,100
<font size="64">- when we do this. - That's true.</font>

3632
01:35:44,140 --> 01:35:46,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He keeps opening the lid when the water is not boiling.)</font>

3633
01:35:44,170 --> 01:35:45,430
<font size="64">It will be all right.</font>

3634
01:35:46,000 --> 01:35:48,540
<font size="64">Seok Jin, stop opening the lid!</font>

3635
01:35:48,970 --> 01:35:51,510
<font size="64">I'm losing my mind, so I should at least open this.</font>

3636
01:35:51,610 --> 01:35:53,740
<font size="64">You're way too impatient.</font>

3637
01:35:53,590 --> 01:35:56,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Frustrated)</font>

3638
01:35:55,180 --> 01:35:56,350
<font size="64">Darn it.</font>

3639
01:35:57,260 --> 01:36:00,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Opening again)</font>

3640
01:35:58,580 --> 01:35:59,780
<font size="64">Seok Jin, stop it.</font>

3641
01:36:02,050 --> 01:36:05,490
<font size="64">I'm sorry. It's a disease. You have to understand me.</font>

3642
01:36:02,330 --> 01:36:05,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Embarrassed)</font>

3643
01:36:05,750 --> 01:36:07,460
<font size="64">It's not boiling.</font>

3644
01:36:07,660 --> 01:36:09,990
<font size="64">We need to go to the kitchen and boil it there.</font>

3645
01:36:07,970 --> 01:36:10,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suggesting to use the stove inside the lodging)</font>

3646
01:36:10,060 --> 01:36:11,290
<font size="64">The cooking's not getting anywhere.</font>

3647
01:36:11,290 --> 01:36:13,000
<font size="64">- Should we carry these two? - Let's do that.</font>

3648
01:36:12,440 --> 01:36:15,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Checking again)</font>

3649
01:36:13,000 --> 01:36:15,300
<font size="64">Stop opening the lid, Seok Jin.</font>

3650
01:36:16,130 --> 01:36:17,600
<font size="64">The water just won't boil.</font>

3651
01:36:16,380 --> 01:36:21,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Moving the pot before the eldest dies of frustration)</font>

3652
01:36:17,600 --> 01:36:19,500
<font size="64">- We can't wait forever. - If we don't do this,</font>

3653
01:36:19,540 --> 01:36:21,300
<font size="64">- Seok Jin will blow a fuse. - Right.</font>

3654
01:36:21,300 --> 01:36:23,740
<font size="64">- He will boil with rage. - It's not boiling at all.</font>

3655
01:36:23,740 --> 01:36:25,440
<font size="64">- It's just lukewarm. - It will boil.</font>

3656
01:36:25,470 --> 01:36:27,580
<font size="64">If we had used a smaller pot, it would have boiled.</font>

3657
01:36:25,650 --> 01:36:27,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Complaining)</font>

3658
01:36:27,250 --> 01:36:29,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stopping him)</font>

3659
01:36:27,580 --> 01:36:28,780
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

3660
01:36:30,860 --> 01:36:32,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Satisfied)</font>

3661
01:36:31,010 --> 01:36:32,650
<font size="64">This is it.</font>

3662
01:36:32,760 --> 01:36:34,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Relieved)</font>

3663
01:36:32,920 --> 01:36:34,280
<font size="64">Do we need 2 or 3?</font>

3664
01:36:34,280 --> 01:36:35,550
<font size="64">- Two? - Two is enough.</font>

3665
01:36:34,560 --> 01:36:36,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Adding the noodles right away)</font>

3666
01:36:35,720 --> 01:36:37,420
<font size="64">- I think that would be enough. - Two packs make ten servings.</font>

3667
01:36:37,460 --> 01:36:39,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The noodles got cooked in no time.)</font>

3668
01:36:37,590 --> 01:36:39,990
<font size="64">This is what we need now.</font>

3669
01:36:40,270 --> 01:36:43,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Making it super chewy by adding it in cold water)</font>

3670
01:36:41,190 --> 01:36:43,260
<font size="64">I'm a noodle master. The noodles are really good.</font>

3671
01:36:43,260 --> 01:36:45,530
<font size="64">You're a father-in-law who is a noodle master.</font>

3672
01:36:43,870 --> 01:36:47,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A morning joke)</font>

3673
01:36:45,530 --> 01:36:47,500
<font size="64">- Yes. Look at this. - You're a noodle master.</font>

3674
01:36:47,500 --> 01:36:48,530
<font size="64">We can just put them in here.</font>

3675
01:36:48,530 --> 01:36:49,730
<font size="64">We can dish out the noodles by hand later.</font>

3676
01:36:49,710 --> 01:36:54,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The noodles are glossy and bouncy.)</font>

3677
01:36:51,000 --> 01:36:52,900
<font size="64">- Kyeong Hwan. - That's enough.</font>

3678
01:36:52,900 --> 01:36:54,240
<font size="64">It's done.</font>

3679
01:36:54,470 --> 01:36:56,710
<font size="64">- We might get scolded. - I want the members...</font>

3680
01:36:56,710 --> 01:36:58,410
<font size="64">to enjoy the food a lot.</font>

3681
01:36:58,180 --> 01:37:00,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will Seok Sam's sincerity be felt?)</font>

3682
01:36:58,470 --> 01:36:59,880
<font size="64">I'm serious.</font>

3683
01:37:00,280 --> 01:37:01,840
<font size="64">This is it.</font>

3684
01:37:00,890 --> 01:37:04,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The sun rises while they're cooking.)</font>

3685
01:37:01,840 --> 01:37:03,850
<font size="64">Let's go. This is it.</font>

3686
01:37:04,480 --> 01:37:05,850
<font size="64">What is this smell?</font>

3687
01:37:06,680 --> 01:37:09,050
<font size="64">- Hurry up and come here. - Is it tteokguk?</font>

3688
01:37:08,490 --> 01:37:10,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They get up one by one thanks to the delicious smell.)</font>

3689
01:37:09,250 --> 01:37:11,120
<font size="64">- No, it's janchi guksu. - That sounds great.</font>

3690
01:37:11,120 --> 01:37:12,390
<font size="64">It's amazing. Hurry and come over.</font>

3691
01:37:12,390 --> 01:37:14,590
<font size="64">- Hurry. - We worked really hard.</font>

3692
01:37:14,960 --> 01:37:16,290
<font size="64">- To make it delicious. - Great job.</font>

3693
01:37:16,040 --> 01:37:19,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Janchi guksu that looks pretty good is ready.)</font>

3694
01:37:16,290 --> 01:37:18,060
<font size="64">- It looks amazing. - You did a great job.</font>

3695
01:37:18,060 --> 01:37:20,530
<font size="64">- But Seok Jin... - You should give us a big hand.</font>

3696
01:37:19,610 --> 01:37:22,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Clapping like a seal)</font>

3697
01:37:20,530 --> 01:37:22,260
<font size="64">- Thank you. - Give us a round of applause.</font>

3698
01:37:22,170 --> 01:37:24,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bragging)</font>

3699
01:37:22,260 --> 01:37:23,600
<font size="64">We worked really hard.</font>

3700
01:37:24,700 --> 01:37:27,040
<font size="64">These are the fried eggs I made this morning.</font>

3701
01:37:26,710 --> 01:37:29,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok's fried eggs are an excellent side dish.)</font>

3702
01:37:27,100 --> 01:37:29,100
<font size="64">- It's good, isn't it? - Eat it when it's warm.</font>

3703
01:37:29,440 --> 01:37:31,210
<font size="64">- Add the seasoning sauce. - Try this.</font>

3704
01:37:29,780 --> 01:37:32,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're ready to enjoy after adding Ye Eun's sauce.)</font>

3705
01:37:31,210 --> 01:37:32,440
<font size="64">It's really good.</font>

3706
01:37:33,690 --> 01:37:35,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Slurping the broth)</font>

3707
01:37:33,740 --> 01:37:35,240
<font size="64">Gosh, I'm cold.</font>

3708
01:37:36,080 --> 01:37:37,110
<font size="64">Is it too bland?</font>

3709
01:37:37,110 --> 01:37:38,510
<font size="64">- No, it tastes good. - It's good, isn't it?</font>

3710
01:37:38,510 --> 01:37:39,780
<font size="64">- It's so tasty. - It's really good.</font>

3711
01:37:39,780 --> 01:37:40,920
<font size="64">Gosh, I'm cold.</font>

3712
01:37:40,790 --> 01:37:43,930
